    "en": "Grammar holds Pāṇini and Piṅgala. Smṛiti holds texts on dharma, law and ethics, such as the Manu-smṛiti. Medicine holds the Charakasamhitā and Suśhrutasamhitā. Kāvya holds Kālidāsa's two poems. Tamil literature holds the Tirukkural, the two epics and the Sangam texts."
